    and 4.2: the copy is passed on, the permission is not moved. Your own
    permission ends only as provided in section 11, and a recipient who complies
    with section 4.1 keeps the permission they received with the copy.

    Three limits follow:

    (a) Non-commercial only. No Distribution under section 4.1(c) or section 4.2
        grants the recipient any commercial right. A recipient who wants one
        must obtain it from the Copyright Holder under section 5.
    (b) Not the contributor grant. Section 8.4 — including the right to
        relicense a contribution under commercial or other terms — is granted to
